    "body": "## Summary\n- Updates the canonical selector inventory to GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6 Sol, GPT-6 Luna, GPT-5.6 Sol, GPT-5.6 Terra, GPT-5.6 Luna, and GPT-5.5.\n- Records exactly 8 models and 44 model-effort pairs, with no Ultra for either Luna and no Max/Ultra for GPT-5.5.\n- Preserves accepted floor anchors and documents deterministic capability-rank extension. Ranks are independent of cost.\n- Refreshes cost authority from the current official OpenAI ChatGPT Work/Codex rate card: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11481834-chatgpt-rate-card-business-enterpriseedu-credit-based-pricing\n- Gameplay and runtime product code are untouched.\n\n## Floor ranks\n- GPT-6.1 Sol: 4\n- GPT-6 Astra: 3\n- GPT-6 Sol: 3\n- GPT-6 Luna: 3\n- GPT-5.6 Sol: 2\n- GPT-5.6 Terra: 1\n- GPT-5.6 Luna: 0\n- GPT-5.5: -1\n\n## Validation\n- Focused inventory tests: 9/9 PASS\n- All current selector tests: 9/9 PASS (this is the full selector test set present on current main)\n- Python compile: PASS\n- Orchestration policy validator: PASS_REPOSITORY_POLICY\n- Snapshot regeneration: 8 models / 44 pairs; canonical hash sha256:25e31adbc721866221bae84814c4154b4118e1e0157909eee580a8cfd34abbd6; stored snapshot reproduced\n- Cost coverage: 8/8 models\n- Floor-rank coverage and unknown-model fail-closed behavior: PASS\n- git diff --check: PASS\n- validate_ai_work_pipeline.py reports the same pre-existing errors on baseline main and this branch, all in unrelated 20260717/20260719 task records.\n- Historical tools/validate-asynchronia-auto-model-preflight.py is absent from current main; it was not restored.\n\nBase: f24428555ea4d156b8302d991bb944a2b010157d\n",
